  "description": {
    "text": "The 2007 Pokémon World Championships, held from 10 to 12 August 2007 at the Hilton Waikoloa Village in Hawaii. Tropical Wind returned, and every competitor got it in seven languages, stamped \"Worlds 07\", in a nine-pocket binder page. Top finishers got copies stamped with their placing from Top Thirty-Two up to Finalist, and staff a Staff copy.\n\nThe top three of each age division received No. 1 to No. 3 Trainer trophy cards.",
